@startuml
title Member C - Accepted evidence and independent review\nMC-SEQ-0.1 candidate, 2026-09-12
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #EEF4F8
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #27465B
skinparam ArrowColor #27465B
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFF5D9
autonumber
participant "Domain Service\nA - sole business writer" as D
participant "Orchestrator\nA - bounded work" as O
participant "Assessment\nA" as A
participant "Retrieval / verification\nC1" as C1
participant "Independent reviewer\nC2" as C2
actor "Founder" as F

D -> O : Admit authorised current analysis work
note over D,O
Accepted order block before proposal -> manual-only target;
missing facts -> Coordinator; technical errors -> bounded recovery.
The loop below requires an admissible current input.
end note
loop First admitted round; repeat iff admitted REVISE and budget remains
  O -> D : Read authorised full current input / source facts
  D --> O : Original statements, order lookup, scoped attachments
  O -> A : assess_case(authorised input, corrections)
  A -> C1 : retrieve(RetrievalRequest) [CS A15]
  C1 --> A : Complete RetrievalResult (including conflicts)
  C1 -> O : Original retrieval receipt [CS A19]
  O -> D : Submit receipt with source/work bindings [CS A02]
  D -> D : Validate and accept original source observation
  A --> O : Candidate DecisionPacket (no authority)
  O -> C1 : verify_citations(CitationVerificationRequest)
  C1 --> O : CitationVerificationResult
  O -> D : Candidate + complete independent materials
  break Invalid binding / capacity / required material unavailable
    D --> O : No new current proposal; actual typed failure
    note over D,O : Preserve history; never truncate to preview or invent source text.
  end
  D -> D : Atomically accept packet + HistoricalProposalBundle + audit
  O -> D : Select current work/round/invocation; load accepted review input
  D --> O : RiskReviewRequest from accepted bundle
  O -> C2 : review(RiskReviewRequest), separate prompt/invocation
  note over A,C2
  No Assessment hidden reasoning. Evidence matrix is an interpretation.
  Original sources, order and statements remain independent comparison material.
  C2 cannot edit packet, write state, approve or call providers.
  end note
  alt Selected invocation yields a reply
    C2 --> O : Untrusted RiskReview candidate
    O -> D : Validate/accept reply with selected identity
  else Timeout or malformed output
    O -> D : Selected invocation failure event (not RiskReview)
  end
  D -> D : Atomic guard on work / round / invocation and current context
  break Obsolete event or replaced context
    D --> O : No change to newer round / business audit outcome
  end
  break Current technical failure
    D -> D : Retire selected invocation; bounded retry or failure handling
    note over D,O
    Retry / exhaustion must match the selected failed invocation.
    A late failure event cannot retire a newer same-version retry.
    A retry uses a newly selected invocation; never synthesize PASS.
    end note
  end
  D -> D : Store valid RiskReview and exact proposal history ref + audit
  alt PASS / PASS_WITH_WARNING and other review-ready guards
    D --> F : Current packet and visible warnings; no execution authority
  else REVISE and machine budget remains
    D --> O : Schedule new proposal_version with specific corrections
    note over D,O : Old result retained, no old approval carried forward.
  else NEEDS_INFORMATION
    D --> O : Coordinator questions -> authorised UC-01E path
    note over D,O : Leave machine loop; accepted answer changes input, then new proposal/review.
  else ESCALATE or exhausted revision budget
    D --> F : Explicit risk / bound reason, no direct approval
    note over D,F
    Current proposal: valid REQUEST_REVISION or MANUAL_HANDLING.
    No proposal: exact current ProcessingFailure/OrderLookupBlock,
    MANUAL_HANDLING only; no fabricated RiskReview or proposal.
    end note
  end
end
legend bottom
Loop repeats only for an admitted revision; all other branches yield/stop this episode.
Method labels describe internal messages, not new wire fields or public HTTP routes.
All state-changing events (reply, timeout, invalidation, retry, exhaustion) use atomic identity guards.
AI-assisted refinement of the shared report discussion candidate; runtime and A/C review pending.
endlegend
@enduml
